 <h3><u>Zainab meri behna</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=5></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=5><small>Zainab meri behna</small></font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=5> </font></u></b>
  <font size=4><p>Zainab meri behna</p> <p>Ye sheh ne kaha</p> <p>Zainab meri behna, dukhya meri behna</p> <p>Lawt kar shaam ke, zindaan se jab aanaa zainab</p> <p>Tum mere kabr pe, ik shamaa jalaana zainab</p> <p>Yaad rakhna ye baat, ay meri jaan, meri behna</p> <p>Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna</p> <p>Tum fateha sharbat pe dilana meri behna</p> <p>Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Gham mere azadar manayenge jahaa me, (ay meri behna) x2</li>
    <p>Percham kahi taabut kahi hongi sabile, (ay meri behna) x2</p>
    <p>Majlis me sabilo pe bhi jaana meri behna</p>
    <p>Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna</p>
    <p>Tum fateha sharbat pe dilana meri behna</p>
    <p>(Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna) x2</p>
    <li>Matam jo azadar kare farshe azaa par, (ay meri behna) x2</li>
    <p>Wo ashk bahaaye jo masayib mere sunkar, (ay meri behna) x2</p>
    <p>Daman me un ashko ko chupana meri behna</p>
    <p>Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna</p>
    <p>Tum fateha sharbat pe dilana meri behna</p>
    <p>(Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna) x2</p>
    <li>Abbas ke parcham ko sajaaye jo azadar, (ay meri behna) x2</li>
    <p>Bacho ko mera sakaa banaaye jo azadar, (ay meri behna) x2</p>
    <p>Abbas ko darya se bulana meri behna</p>
    <p>Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna</p>
    <p>Tum fateha sharbat pe dilana meri behna</p>
    <p>(Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna) x2</p>
    <li>Jula mere besheer ka phoolo se sajaa kar, (ay meri behna) x2</li>
    <p>Mannat koyi mane muje awlaad ataa kar, (ay meri behna) x2</p>
    <p>Us bibi ki agosh sajaana meri behna</p>
    <p>Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna</p>
    <p>Tum fateha sharbat pe dilana meri behna</p>
    <p>(Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna) x2</p>
    <li>Jab bibiya tabut sakina ka uthaye, (ay meri behna) x2</li>
    <p>Aur nawha sakina ke asiri ka sunaye, (ay meri behna) x2</p>
