    <p>(Zainab meri behna dukhya meri behna) x2</p>
    <li>Agar koyi behen apne baradar se bichar kar, (ay meri behna) x2</li>
    <p>Nawha ye kare lawt ke aajaa ali akber, (ay meri behna) x2</p>
